flag provided but not defined: -addr
Usage of ensemble-gui:
  -base-url string
    	provider origin
  -event-log string
    	durable history path (default "event.log")
  -gui-dir string
    	explicit assets; default embedded
  -model string
    	exact provider model
  -no-stream
    	disable streaming
  -port int
    	localhost HTTP port (default 8088)
  -vendor string
    	anthropic, openai or gemini (default "anthropic")
  -workspace string
    	tool workspace (default launch directory)
